         <lg><l><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="person:3913">bdag</rs> <note type="gloss"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3913">shag kya'i dge slong prad nya badz+ra</rs></note><note type="gloss"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3829">dge ba'i bshes pu to ba</rs>'i slob ma <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3913">rnal 'byor pa shes rab rdo rje</rs>s mdzad pa yin naM</note> gis <note type="gloss">ti ka</note> de bsdebs <note type="gloss">ba las byung ba'i</note> dge ba gang <note type="gloss">zhig</note> thob <note type="gloss">pa</note> des ||</l>
